# Large data files (load via RemoteLoader or local file upload)
# NOTE: ignore the *contents* of public/data/ (not the dir itself) so we can
# selectively re-include folders like templates/ below. Negating a path inside
# a fully-excluded directory does not work in git.
public/data/*
!public/data/templates/
*.parquet
*.csv
out/
